# Context is platform/. This Dockerfile-specific ignore lets kubonad ship
# core/ code, the runtime contracts/, and the native QIR compiler source
# without pulling the console/test/state trees into the build context.
*
!core
!core/**
!crates
!crates/qir-core
!crates/qir-core/**
!contracts
!contracts/**
!docker
!docker/backup-loop.sh
!docker/kubonad-entrypoint.sh
crates/qir-core/target
